    "sections": {
        "description": "<p>OffCanvas is a flexible and intuitive WordPress Gutenberg block that lets you create slide-in drawers and popup-style panels that open from the <strong>left, right, top, or bottom</strong> of the screen. Perfect for building mobile menus, WooCommerce cart drawers, promotional popups, newsletter panels, announcements, and custom sidebar content — all without writing any code.</p>\n<p>This plugin includes complete styling controls, smart trigger options, InnerBlocks support, shortcode generation, and smooth animations. It works with any WordPress theme and is fully responsive.</p>\n<h3>Perfect for:</h3>\n<p>– Mobile off-canvas menus<br />\n– Sliding promotional bars<br />\n– Cart and checkout drawers<br />\n– Contact forms and lead-gen panels<br />\n– Help &amp; support sidebars<br />\n– Newsletter signup panels<br />\n– App-style bottom sheets<br />\n– Custom reusable popup content<br />\n– Slide-in announcements and alerts</p>\n<p>Lightweight, SEO-friendly, and designed for both beginners and professionals.</p>\n<p>—</p>\n<h3>Free Features</h3>\n<p><strong>OffCanvas Drawer Settings</strong><br />\n– Offcanvas Position: Left, Right, Top, Bottom<br />\n– Built-in Trigger Button<br />\n– Clipboard Copy for Shortcode<br />\n– Prevent body scroll when opened<br />\n– Backdrop overlay support</p>\n<p><strong>Button Customization</strong><br />\n– Alignment<br />\n– Typography<br />\n– Text &amp; Icon<br />\n– Colors<br />\n– Margin<br />\n– Shadows</p>\n<p><strong>Popup Customization</strong><br />\n– Background: Solid, Gradient, Image<br />\n– Header: Title typography, colors, close icon styling</p>\n<p><strong>Content Support</strong><br />\n– Full <strong>InnerBlocks</strong> — add any Gutenberg block inside<br />\n– Works anywhere via shortcode</p>\n<p>—</p>\n<h3>Pro Features</h3>\n<p><strong>Smart Triggers &amp; User Behavior</strong><br />\n– Custom Trigger Selector (open using any external element)<br />\n– Show/Hide built-in trigger button<br />\n– Toggle Mode (same button opens &amp; closes)<br />\n– Close on outside click<br />\n– Trigger frequency control<br />\n– Delay Trigger — open after X seconds<br />\n– Scroll Depth Trigger — open at X% scroll<br />\n– Scroll Into View Trigger — open when an element enters viewport<br />\n– Inactivity Trigger — open after no user activity<br />\n– Exit Intent for desktop</p>\n<p><strong>Advanced Design Controls</strong><br />\n– Backdrop color &amp; opacity<br />\n– Animation Types: Slide, Push, Reveal, Fade<br />\n– Slide Direction: Left, Right, Top, Bottom<br />\n– Custom width &amp; height<br />\n– Button border, radius, padding, hover colors<br />\n– Icon size, color, hover color, and position</p>\n<p>—</p>\n<h3>How to Use</h3>\n<ol>\n<li>Install and activate the OffCanvas Block plugin.  </li>\n<li>Open the Gutenberg editor.  </li>\n<li>Add the <strong>OffCanvas Block</strong> from the “Widgets” category.  </li>\n<li>Customize the trigger button, popup area, background, typography, and interactions.  </li>\n<li>Add any content using InnerBlocks.  </li>\n<li>Save and publish!</li>\n</ol>\n<p>You can also use the generated shortcode to display the OffCanvas anywhere on your site.</p>\n<p>—</p>\n",
        "installation": "<h3>From WordPress Admin:</h3>\n<ol>\n<li>Go to <strong>Plugins <span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"wp-exclude-emoji\">→</span> Add New</strong>  </li>\n<li>Search for <strong>OffCanvas Block</strong>  </li>\n<li>Install and activate  </li>\n</ol>\n<h3>Manual Upload:</h3>\n<ol>\n<li>Download the plugin ZIP  </li>\n<li>Upload to <code>/wp-content/plugins/</code>  </li>\n<li>Activate from Plugins menu  </li>\n</ol>\n<h3>From Gutenberg Editor:</h3>\n<ol>\n<li>Open any page/post  </li>\n<li>Search “<strong>OffCanvas Block</strong>”  </li>\n<li>Insert and customize  </li>\n</ol>\n<p>—</p>\n",
        "faq": "\n<dt id='is%20offcanvas%20block%20free%3F'>\nIs OffCanvas Block free?\n</h4>\n<p>\n<p>Yes, the core version is 100% free.</p>\n</p>\n<dt id='does%20it%20work%20with%20any%20theme%3F'>\nDoes it work with any theme?\n</h4>\n<p>\n<p>Yes, it works with all standard WordPress themes and builders.</p>\n</p>\n<dt id='can%20i%20customize%20the%20design%3F'>\nCan I customize the design?\n</h4>\n<p>\n<p>Absolutely — background, button, typography, overlay, animations, and more.</p>\n</p>\n<dt id='can%20i%20use%20it%20multiple%20times%3F'>\nCan I use it multiple times?\n</h4>\n<p>\n<p>Yes, you can create unlimited OffCanvas drawers.</p>\n</p>\n<dt id='where%20do%20i%20get%20support%3F'>\nWhere do I get support?\n</h4>\n<p>\n<p>You can post your questions on the plugin’s support forum.</p>\n<p>—</p>\n</p>\n\n",
        "changelog": "<h4>1.0.1 – 30 Sep 2024</h4>\n<ul>\n<li>Fix: Close button icon visibility.</li>\n</ul>\n<h4>1.0.0</h4>\n<ul>\n<li>Initial Release.</li>\n</ul>\n"
    },
    "short_description": "Create slide-in sidebars, drawers, popups, and mobile menus with a flexible Gutenberg OffCanvas block featuring smart triggers, animations.",
    "description": "<p>OffCanvas is a flexible and intuitive WordPress Gutenberg block that lets you create slide-in drawers and popup-style panels that open from the <strong>left, right, top, or bottom</strong> of the screen. Perfect for building mobile menus, WooCommerce cart drawers, promotional popups, newsletter panels, announcements, and custom sidebar content — all without writing any code.</p>\n<p>This plugin includes complete styling controls, smart trigger options, InnerBlocks support, shortcode generation, and smooth animations. It works with any WordPress theme and is fully responsive.</p>\n<h3>Perfect for:</h3>\n<p>– Mobile off-canvas menus<br />\n– Sliding promotional bars<br />\n– Cart and checkout drawers<br />\n– Contact forms and lead-gen panels<br />\n– Help &amp; support sidebars<br />\n– Newsletter signup panels<br />\n– App-style bottom sheets<br />\n– Custom reusable popup content<br />\n– Slide-in announcements and alerts</p>\n<p>Lightweight, SEO-friendly, and designed for both beginners and professionals.</p>\n<p>—</p>\n<h3>Free Features</h3>\n<p><strong>OffCanvas Drawer Settings</strong><br />\n– Offcanvas Position: Left, Right, Top, Bottom<br />\n– Built-in Trigger Button<br />\n– Clipboard Copy for Shortcode<br />\n– Prevent body scroll when opened<br />\n– Backdrop overlay support</p>\n<p><strong>Button Customization</strong><br />\n– Alignment<br />\n– Typography<br />\n– Text &amp; Icon<br />\n– Colors<br />\n– Margin<br />\n– Shadows</p>\n<p><strong>Popup Customization</strong><br />\n– Background: Solid, Gradient, Image<br />\n– Header: Title typography, colors, close icon styling</p>\n<p><strong>Content Support</strong><br />\n– Full <strong>InnerBlocks</strong> — add any Gutenberg block inside<br />\n– Works anywhere via shortcode</p>\n<p>—</p>\n<h3>Pro Features</h3>\n<p><strong>Smart Triggers &amp; User Behavior</strong><br />\n– Custom Trigger Selector (open using any external element)<br />\n– Show/Hide built-in trigger button<br />\n– Toggle Mode (same button opens &amp; closes)<br />\n– Close on outside click<br />\n– Trigger frequency control<br />\n– Delay Trigger — open after X seconds<br />\n– Scroll Depth Trigger — open at X% scroll<br />\n– Scroll Into View Trigger — open when an element enters viewport<br />\n– Inactivity Trigger — open after no user activity<br />\n– Exit Intent for desktop</p>\n<p><strong>Advanced Design Controls</strong><br />\n– Backdrop color &amp; opacity<br />\n– Animation Types: Slide, Push, Reveal, Fade<br />\n– Slide Direction: Left, Right, Top, Bottom<br />\n– Custom width &amp; height<br />\n– Button border, radius, padding, hover colors<br />\n– Icon size, color, hover color, and position</p>\n<p>—</p>\n<h3>How to Use</h3>\n<ol>\n<li>Install and activate the OffCanvas Block plugin.  </li>\n<li>Open the Gutenberg editor.  </li>\n<li>Add the <strong>OffCanvas Block</strong> from the “Widgets” category.  </li>\n<li>Customize the trigger button, popup area, background, typography, and interactions.  </li>\n<li>Add any content using InnerBlocks.  </li>\n<li>Save and publish!</li>\n</ol>\n<p>You can also use the generated shortcode to display the OffCanvas anywhere on your site.</p>\n<p>—</p>\n",
